  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Survey Research in Central America: Working Conditions, Health, Discrimination and Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To collect original data on the prevalence, nature, and possible effects on workers of a variety of working conditions and health issues, including work-related and gender-based violence, through a national household survey and focus groups in six country partners under the Central America Free Trade Agreement (CAFTA-DR)</narrative>
  </description>
